>Sacfest kept giving repeats, 

  Bump up your experience level.  Go wraith-luring in the VotD,
then come back for more sacrifesting.  You'll also get a lot of
spellbooks from the VotD.

  Once you've been to the VotD you can always the #invoke the Eye 
to return there.  It will show up in the list as Gehennom.
Vlad's tower will be the same, once you've been there. (The Eye
is the only way to "level-port" past the VotD, from either 
direction.  

  It's frequently better to levelport to Sokoban from Gehennom,
Vlad's tower, or even just deep in the main dungeons, and walk
from there than to climb up all the way to where you're going.


  Sokoban is best to #invoke to from below, because Sokoban's
entrance is at the bottom.  (The Eye of Aethiopica takes you 
to the nearest level of the branch you select:  If you're above
the branch, you go to the top level, below - you go to the bottom
level.  

  Going from the Gnomish Mines to the main Dungeons seems to 
take you to the bottom level of the main dungeon (generally
the level above the castle.)  This can be *very* handy.
  

  Once you've reached Vlad's, the Eye can usually let you 
port back close to your stash, then back to Vlad's very
easily.

